Package: excheckr
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Exploring and Checking Experimental Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Alexander", "Coppock",
      email = "acoppock@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Functions for diagnosing, summarizing, and visualizing covariate
    balance, differential attrition, missingness, and data integrity in
    experimental datasets. Includes per-study checks that can be labelled and
    stacked across many studies, plus triage and uniform-reference diagnostics
    for the resulting collection of tests. A second group of functions audits
    the claims an article makes about such data, scoring every number the text
    prints against the value the analysis pipeline produces and against any
    correction a published erratum supplies, and failing the run when a claim
    is in neither state.
URL: https://alexandercoppock.com/excheckr/, https://github.com/acoppock/excheckr
